GOAL\
\
Extend the existing project so students can:\
1. Evaluate eight fixed responses using an LLM judge.\
2. Compare judge assessments with confirmed human labels.\
3. Compare two response-generation prompts fairly.\
4. Repeat selected requests and inspect observed variation.\
5. Preserve evidence, errors and human-review decisions.\
\
Keep the implementation small, readable and suitable for beginners.\
No web interface, RAG pipeline, tool-executing agent or orchestration\
framework is needed.\
