Cover:\
- Proposed labels are not treated as confirmed human reviews.\
- Judge input excludes labels and answer keys.\
- Generation input excludes fixed responses and answer keys.\
- Prompt labels are hidden from the judge.\
- Invalid judge output becomes an evaluation error.\
- Critical violations cannot pass through a high total score.\
- Calibration handles zero confirmed labels and missing results.\
- Label/version mismatches are detected.\
- Live errors do not silently become replay results.\
- Existing reports cannot be overwritten.\
- Repeated runs retain every result and error.\
